Input: {"question": "What is the profession of Peter Jacobs?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0466-24d51953b85d:d00", "start": 0, "end": 109, "text": "Peter Jacobs (fencer) Peter Jacobs (born 26 September 1938) is a British fencer who competed at the Olympics."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0466-24d51953b85d:d00", "start": 110, "end": 182, "text": "Jacobs was born in Pinner, Greater London, Great Britain, and is Jewish."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0466-24d51953b85d:d00", "start": 183, "end": 249, "text": "He attended and fenced for Queens College in Cambridge University."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0466-24d51953b85d:d00", "start": 250, "end": 319, "text": "Jacobs won the Great Britain team epee championship in 1962 and 1964."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0466-24d51953b85d:d00", "start": 320, "end": 475, "text": "He won a bronze medal in epee and a gold medal in epee team at the 1962 Commonwealth Games in Perth, and again in the 1970 Commonwealth Games in Edinburgh."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0466-24d51953b85d:d00", "start": 476, "end": 574, "text": "Jacobs competed in individual and team epee at the 1964 Summer Olympics in Tokyo, and in team epee"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0466-24d51953b85d:d01", "start": 0, "end": 561, "text": "Peter Jacobs : Fencer ( 1938- ) | Biography , Facts , Information , Career , Wiki , Life People United Kingdom Peter Jacobs peoplepill id : peter-jacobs-1 PJ 1 views today 1 views this week Fencer Peter Jacobs Biography Lists Also Viewed The basics Quick Facts Intro Fencer Places United Kingdom is Athlete Fencer Work field Sports Gender Male Birth 26 September 1938 People who share this birthday Place of birth Pinner , United Kingdom Star sign Libra People who share this birthday Age 86 years Stats Height : 176 cm Weight : 61 kg Education Queens ' Co